        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlet of any real skoof is a summer cottage! Away from worries, work, and dumb colleagues and bosses. This is a real summer cottage simulator where there is no place for a vegetable garden. Skoof songs on the radio, alcoholic drinks and absolute freedom are exactly what a real skoof needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can chop firewood and light a sauna to have a good steam or dry mushrooms, or you can run through the woods all night on your old penny and listen to your favorite music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skoof has no purpose! You decide exactly how to spend your time in the country.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlet of any real skoof is a summer cottage! Away from worries, work, and dumb colleagues and bosses. This is a real summer cottage simulator where there is no place for a vegetable garden. Skoof songs on the radio, alcoholic drinks and absolute freedom are exactly what a real skoof needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can chop firewood and light a sauna to have a good steam or dry mushrooms, or you can run through the woods all night on your old penny and listen to your favorite music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skoof has no purpose! You decide exactly how to spend your time in the country.</p>",
        "short_description": "A cottage is not just about garden beds! Dacha is primarily a solitude with oneself. Flood the sauna, go mushroom picking, and ride an old bucket over the village potholes in an immersive country simulator.",
